eriences may only be available on certain platforms. \n\nMore FAQs: https://roblox.com/the-games","path":"/game/18320910606-the-games","slug":"18320910606-the-games","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/914d45f977333e849c6d8c5d2a28fc3d486a642c6243c1a034770d07ce334f94.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ae8d0d725dcaad6c0597cfacf5a4d052/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":82172784,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-08-08T22:34:17.825Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox Presents","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":94249547303335,"name":"Escape Guards to Grab Brainrots 🧠","desc":"Escape Guards to Grab Brainrots 🧠\n\n-How to Play? 🎮\n-Run fast and Steal Brainrots From Guards! 🏃💂\n-Upgrade your speed and become faster ⚡\n-Stay alive and collect many Brainrots! 🛡️\n-Upgrade your base to unlock more slots and place extra Brainrots! 🏗️\n-Upgrade your Brainrots and get more money! 💸\n\nYour Brainrots earn cash OFFLINE! 💤\nLike the game and join the group for FREE EPIC BRAINROT! 👍","path":"/game/94249547303335-escape-guards-to-grab-brainrots","slug":"94249547303335-escape-guards-to-grab-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/37a5c7f8ba95c0c0666e2d332e2613b107775b189a09bf9ead2b4398e0fe830f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6210ab3daf7629eb804f5238d0dbc5a5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":14563648,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-19T17:07:25.912Z","creator":{"name":"Escapes With Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":74268130525137,"name":"[🍀] Steal FPS from Others!","desc":"👍 LIKE + FAVORITE THE GAME FOR MORE UPDATES\n\nWelcome to Steal FPS from Others!\n\n👑 Enter a world where FPS = Power\n⚡ The more fps you have, the smoother you will play!\n⚔️ Get the best swords from the crates\n🕐 Every second outside the safe zone will give you FPS\n✨ Mythic swords make the best VFX animations\n\ntags